Subject: [PATCH 1/3] mETaLcast v0.3.0

mETaLcast branding across frontend and backend. Custom public-page domain
support per station with dedicated nginx server block (Centrifugo, stream
mounts, SSL). w3K CI/CD workflow. RSAS integration. Asset overlay.

Based on AzuraCast upstream as of 2026-06-20.
